<title>AUSTRALIA: RTRS-Centaur Mining half year loss widens.</title>
<headline>RTRS-Centaur Mining half year loss widens.</headline>
<dateline>MELBOURNE 1997-03-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months ended December 31</p>
<p>	    (million A$ unless stated)</p>
<p>    Operating profit	 loss   5.07 vs loss 1.97</p>
<p>    Net			  loss   6.09 vs loss 1.27</p>
<p>    Abnormal items	   loss   1.18 vs gain 0.71</p>
<p>    Extraordinary items    gain  29.89 vs nil</p>
<p>    Sales				27.18 vs 0.47</p>
<p>    Dividend (cents)		   nil vs nil</p>
<p>NOTE: Centaur Mining and Exploration Ltd, part of the Joe Gutnick group, said the extraordinary gain arises from dilution of interest in a controlled entity.  </p>
<p>-- Sydney newsroom 61-2 9373 1800</p>
</text>
